        "x1": 0.8725481220320159,
        "y1": 0.8140909214212437
      },
      "text": "more on spherical codes. Problem 1.1 has connection even with sphere packing [16]. Most used method",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
